==== hyperbricks yaml {!{page}} ====
base_content:
  - type: tree

  - text_summary:
      - type: text
      - value: Intro

  - text_summary:
      - type: text
      - value: Summary

page:
  - type: hypermedia
  - route: duplicate-inheritance-path

  - content:
      - inherit: base_content

      - text_summary_2:
          - value: Summary override

      - summary_copy:
          - inherit: base_content.text_summary_2
          - value: Copied summary override
==== explainer ====
Recovered duplicate names become real runtime paths.
An inherited TREE can override text_summary_2 by name, and another child can inherit directly from base_content.text_summary_2.
==== expected json ====
{
  "@order": [
    "content"
  ],
  "@type": "<HYPERMEDIA>",
  "content": {
    "@order": [
      "text_summary",
      "text_summary_2",
      "summary_copy"
    ],
    "@type": "<TREE>",
    "summary_copy": {
      "@type": "<TEXT>",
      "value": "Copied summary override"
    },
    "text_summary": {
      "@type": "<TEXT>",
      "value": "Intro"
    },
    "text_summary_2": {
      "@type": "<TEXT>",
      "value": "Summary override"
    }
  },
  "route": "duplicate-inheritance-path"
}
==== expected diagnostics ====
[
  {
    "type": "YAML",
    "path": "base_content",
    "key": "text_summary",
    "level": "WARNING",
    "contains": "using \"text_summary_2\" as runtime path"
  }
]
==== expected output ====
<!DOCTYPE html><html><body>IntroSummary overrideCopied summary override</body></html>
